{"code":"21411629","hash":"6abd3b61863df427ceba2d1a","playerName":"hocTA40387","room":{"code":"21411629","assignments":null,"createdAt":1790786401266,"scheduledAt":null,"deleted":false,"experiment":"main_main","hash":"6abd3b61863df427ceba2d1a","hostId":"690381fad70ac7916cf6a8c9","hostSessionId":"5f272590-064e-4626-ae2e-bf6c3e0a31d6","hostOccupation":"personal","canvas":{"host":false,"player":false,"annotations":false},"name":"FOUR DAY WORKWEEK ","options":{"accommodations":"no","showAnswers_2":"always","studentQuizReview_2":"yes","redemption":"no","powerups":"no","loginRequired":false,"jumble":false,"jumbleAnswers":true,"showAnswers":true,"studentQuizReview":true,"studentLeaderboard":false,"timer":false,"timer_3":"off","memes":false,"memeset":"66ffb7ce6c18f9cf20f405f5","studentMusic":false,"limitAttempts":0,"nicknameGenerator":false,"extraLife":"","scheduleLater":false,"gameRunningDuration":-1,"reduceMotion":false,"showGameCountdown":true,"showGameSummary":true,"showPlayerAttemptDetails":true,"isIcebreakerQuiz":false,"assignOnGCAddon":false,"hasRedemptionPass":"no","allowIssues":false,"isMasteryPeakTimerEnabled":false,"adaptive":false,"mandatoryRosterName":false,"areHintsEnabled":false,"skipQuestion":false,"preventSkipping":true,"videoSpeed":false,"captionsEnabled":false,"isNoFrills":false,"antiCheating":{"enabled":true,"alertOnInfraction":false,"disableRightClick":false,"disableCopyPaste":false},"readAloud":false,"calculator":false,"fourFnCalculator":false,"graphing":false,"dontRewardMarksForUngradableQuestions":false,"showReferenceNotes":false,"stickyNotepad":false,"globalNotepad":false,"protractor":false},"questions":{"68cc2787474ad9cd98417438":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>For generations, people have marched to the same rhythm: start on Monday, endure five steady beats, and pause only when Saturday arrives. This pattern has guided schools, transport, and even family life. Yet rhythms can grow outdated, just like a once-popular song that no longer fits the mood. With technology reshaping communication and growing concern for well-being, many argue that the old cadence of five working days no longer serves its purpose. The idea of working only four days each week is thus presented less as an experiment than as a natural evolution of the score.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Difficult to change old habits</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"68cc2787474ad9cd98417438","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2025-09-18T15:38:47.505Z","updated":"2025-09-18T15:42:41.389Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"68cc27a41ed2fbfb94db8f5a":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>When companies tested shorter weeks, the results sounded almost too good to be true. Staff returned from their extended weekends with sharper focus and steadier energy, reporting fewer sick days and greater enthusiasm. Some said they finally had time to cook, to exercise, or simply to breathe. Employers noted that tasks were not neglected but often completed with greater efficiency. Rather than shrinking output, the extra day of rest seemed to sharpen the tools of the mind. These findings suggest that a leaner schedule may paradoxically create richer outcomes for both people and organizations.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Difficult to change old habits</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"68cc27a41ed2fbfb94db8f5a","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2025-09-18T15:39:16.091Z","updated":"2025-09-18T15:42:41.389Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"68cc27b8df70c2b120baa34b":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>Still, every advantage carries a cost. If wages remain the same but hours fall, then someone must shoulder the difference. For large firms, this may mean hiring more staff; for small businesses, it may mean higher prices or reduced investment. Governments worry, too, about weaker tax revenues should productivity slip. Even loyal customers may grow impatient if services are unavailable on certain days. The ledger of the four-day week, therefore, is not written only in happier employees but also in heavier expenses—an equation that some fear may not balance.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Difficult to change old habits</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"68cc27b8df70c2b120baa34b","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2025-09-18T15:39:36.133Z","updated":"2025-09-18T15:42:41.389Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"68cc27e06c4d095a5e924515":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>&nbsp;Supporters often promise balance, but reality can lean the other way. When tasks designed for five days are packed into four, the pace accelerates. Workers speak of meetings crowding their calendars and deadlines chasing them more aggressively. The extra day off sometimes feels like a mirage, cancelled out by the fatigue of longer shifts. Those who value a steady routine may find the constant compression unsettling. Without careful redesign, the dream of harmony may collapse into exhaustion, proving that fewer days do not automatically mean lighter burdens.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"