en comes not from logic but from the comfort of long-standing familiarity.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Difficult to change old habits</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"68cc280e4253ffafa31b6c6a","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2025-09-18T15:41:02.593Z","updated":"2025-09-18T15:42:41.389Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"68cc283d4dc70afea1fc4bbd":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>What appears to be liberation can, for some, feel like captivity. The compressed schedule demands sustained attention, as if workers are asked to sprint four marathons back-to-back. Days become dense with meetings and tasks, leaving little room to pause. By Friday evening, exhaustion may outweigh the pleasure of the promised extra day off. The fairness of such an arrangement is therefore questioned: a gift of time that, paradoxically, takes more than it gives. Only by redesigning workload carefully can employers ensure that relief is genuine rather than illusory.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Unfair for some people</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","marks":{"correct":1,"incorrect":0}},"topics":[],"unifiedStandardIds":[],"cloned":true,"ver":2,"_id":"68cc283d4dc70afea1fc4bbd","time":30000,"type":"MCQ","createdAt":"2025-09-18T15:41:49.576Z","updated":"2025-09-18T15:42:41.389Z","state":"inactive","attempt":0},"68cc28666d2f78189c58764e":{"structure":{"settings":{"hasCorrectAnswer":true,"fibDataType":"string","canSubmitCustomResponse":false,"doesOptionHaveMultipleTargets":false,"showAdvancedRTE":false},"hasMath":false,"query":{"type":null,"hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":-1,"text":"<p>TOPIC: <strong>FOUR DAY WORKWEEK</strong></p><p>Because no single remedy suits every patient, some experts urge flexibility. Rather than imposing a uniform four-day rule, they propose models shaped by context: flexible hours, seasonal shifts, or simple permission to leave once essential tasks are done. In these experiments, the focus moves from counting days to valuing productivity. The message is clear: what matters is not the calendar itself but the quality of life it enables. Diverse approaches may, in the end, serve the common purpose of building healthier and more sustainable ways of working.</p>","media":[]},"options":[{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9","text":"<p><strong>&nbsp;A way of life now outdated</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0f9"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa","text":"<p><strong>Benefits for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fa"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb","text":"<p><strong>Undesirable financial consequences</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fb"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc","text":"<p><strong>Unforeseen challenges for employees</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83e22b3a587e0d4f4e0fc"},{"type":"text","hasMath":false,"math":{"latex":[],"template":null},"answerTime":0,"id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110","text":"<p><strong>Alternative solutions worth considering</strong></p>","media":[],"_id":"68c83ed1b3a587e0d4f4e110"}],"explain":{},"hints":[],"kind":"MCQ","ma